    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“You don’t just stand on the ground. You negotiate with it.”</em></p><p>When you plant your feet, the world quietly updates its assumptions about where ‘down’ is.</p><ul><li>You are exceptionally good at shoving, bracing, and making your presence felt physically.</li><li>Your melee attacks hit objects and structures harder.</li><li>In Bad Eden strategic play, your sheer bulk helps stabilize Slippage hexes and nudges Non-Lethal OP budgets (handled via flags). Your Gravity Well also supports an optional OP trigger when you successfully shove something—implemented as a ‘Do you want to apply this OP change?’ card, never automatic.</li></ul>",
